      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n\ntitle StudyFlow AI - Missed Session &amp; Automatic Rescheduling\n\nactor Student\nboundary \&quot;Flutter App\&quot; as App\ncontrol \&quot;StudySessionController\&quot; as Controller\ncontrol \&quot;ReschedulingService\&quot; as Rescheduler\ndatabase \&quot;PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB\n\nStudent -&gt; App : Mark session as missed\n\nactivate App\n\nApp -&gt; Controller : PATCH /api/study-sessions/{id}/miss\n\nactivate Controller\n\nController -&gt; Rescheduler : rescheduleMissedSession(sessionId)\n\nactivate Rescheduler\n\n&#39; Get missed session\nRescheduler -&gt; DB : Find StudySession by ID\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Rescheduler : StudySession\ndeactivate DB\n\n&#39; Mark as missed\nRescheduler -&gt; Rescheduler : Set status = MISSED\n\nRescheduler -&gt; DB : Update StudySession\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Rescheduler : Updated\ndeactivate DB\n\n&#39; Get related deadline\nRescheduler -&gt; DB : Get related Deadline\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Rescheduler : Deadline\ndeactivate DB\n\n&#39; Get future availability\nRescheduler -&gt; DB : Get user&#39;s future availability\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Rescheduler : Available time slots\ndeactivate DB\n\n&#39; Get existing sessions\nRescheduler -&gt; DB : Get upcoming StudySessions\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Rescheduler : Existing sessions\ndeactivate DB\n\n&#39; Rescheduling logic\nRescheduler -&gt; Rescheduler : Calculate remaining workload\n\nRescheduler -&gt; Rescheduler : Recalculate priority\n\nRescheduler -&gt; Rescheduler : Find valid free time slot\n\nalt Free slot available\n\n    Rescheduler -&gt; Rescheduler : Create replacement StudySession\n\n    Rescheduler -&gt; DB : Save replacement session\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt; Rescheduler : Saved session\n    deactivate DB\n\n    Rescheduler --&gt; Controller : Updated schedule\n\n    Controller --&gt; App : 200 OK + Updated schedule\n\n    App --&gt; Student : Show rescheduled session\n\nelse No valid slot available\n\n    Rescheduler --&gt; Controller : Rescheduling conflict\n\n    Controller --&gt; App : 409 Conflict\n\n    App --&gt; Student : Show scheduling warning\n\nend\n\ndeactivate Rescheduler\ndeactivate Controller\ndeactivate App\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="ScdTWE8a7w1WkjKcIP3C-395">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
